  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ThuyKieu.Gameplay.Sequences.TutorialSequence
  _id: tutorial_classroom
  _body: "<color=#E8C27A>\u0110i l\u1EA1i:</color> WASD \xB7 <color=#E8C27A>xoay camera:</color> chu\u1ED9t\n<color=#E8C27A>T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c:</color> \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n th\u1EE9 c\xF3 d\u1EA5u \u25C6 v\xE0ng r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m <color=#E8C27A>E</color>\n<color=#E8C27A>L\u1EDDi tho\u1EA1i:</color> Space / click \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFp, 1\u20134 \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi\n\nThu d\u1ECDn s\xE1ch v\u1EDF tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi v\u1EC1. C\xF2n v\xE0i ph\xFAt \u2014 c\u1EE9 thong th\u1EA3 nh\xECn quanh l\u1EDBp."
  _controlsHint: "WASD: \u0111i \xB7 E: t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c \xB7 Space: ti\u1EBFp l\u1EDDi tho\u1EA1i \xB7 Esc: t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng"
